            "title": "Q3 wrap-up: Top stock performers & 2 reasons for a bullish Q4",
            "description": "<p><a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/robinhood-applovin-emcor-joining-p-100000268.html\">AppLovin</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/APP\">APP</a>), <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/paramount-ellisons-might-not-cash-190500542.html\">Warner Bros. Discovery</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/WBD\">WBD</a>), <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/western-digital-stock-surges-closer-183000610.html\">Western Digital</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/WDC\">WDC</a>), and <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/intels-comeback-is-fueled-by-the-promise-of-more-deals-100030675.html\">Intel</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/INTC\">INTC</a>) were some of the top-performing stocks in the third quarter of 2025.</p>\n<p><a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/investors-watching-markets-heading-q4-140915692.html\">Looking ahead to the fourth quarter</a>, Hennion & Walsh chief investment officer Kevin Mahn says two factors are driving his expectations for a fruitful final quarter.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>",
